valign="top" char="." charoff="50">(0.81, 6.32)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.28</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">(0.94, 5.58)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02003;Rate 15&#x02013;adult<sup>c</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1080</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">14</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.55</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">(0.86, 7.55)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.30</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">(0.94, 5.61)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;At 2 yrs&#x0002b;rates<sup>d</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">768</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">13</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2.21</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">(0.63, 7.72)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.87</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">(0.73, 4.78)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a